    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSite with full planning permission for a 355 sq. m / 3,821 sq. ft three storey architect designed bespoke five-bedroom house with four reception rooms, large garage, private parking and expansive scenic viewing terraces on exceptionally beautiful, elevated south facing landscaped site of c. 0.35 acres, providing an abundant private garden space. Architect's plans are included. Site has existing tarmac road access and excellent access to services. Residential zoning, additional extension or larger development potential subject to planning.\n\nA rare opportunity to build your dream homes on two stunning building sites located near the picturesque village of Enniskerry, Co. Wicklow. Two large sites commanding stunning views and nestled in a serene silvanian and highly sought after area close to Dublin. These sites offer the perfect blend of beauty, tranquillity and convenient access to urban amenities. Both sites are conveniently located, just 2 minutes from the M11 and south Dublin, less than 30 minutes from St. Stephen's Green or Dublin Airport. \n\nKey Features:\nLocation: A stunning landscape just off Fassaroe Avenue, near Enniskerry, Co. Wicklow, less than two 2 minutes' drive to the M11 motorway, a few minutes from Enniskerry Village, Powerscourt Estate and Golf Club, or Bray Town Centre, 15 minutes to Dundrum Town Centre, less than 30 minutes to St. Stephen's Green, Dublin Airport, or to Brittas Bay.\n\nSouth facing elevated secluded sites with spectacular and breathtaking views of the Wicklow mountains and surrounding majestic countryside, mature trees on site and stunning array of beautiful wildlife.\n\nSize: Both sites extend approx. 0.35 acres, with full planning permission for two large 3 storey houses with each house having its own garage and large garden.\n\nFull Planning Permission: Both sites are shovel ready with full planning permission; inclusive of existing architectural plans, existing tarmac road access as well as excellent access to services.\n\nProximity to amenities: Located just minutes away from the charming Enniskerry village Centre, with shops, cafes and restaurants. Bray promenade with its bars and restaurants located nearby, as is Bray Dart Station. With excellent access to public transport to Dublin and the surrounding areas, the site is located within 400m from the proposed future LUAS stop. \n\nAccess: Private security entrance with iron electric gates, tarmac access roads have been constructed to the sites.\n\nCommunity: A friendly and welcoming community with top-rated schools and recreational facilities nearby, located 3 minutes' drive to St. Gerards School."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Conor Donnelly"
      }
    ],
